nt-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">2</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>月<rt>つき</rt></ruby>になりましたね！！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>今月<rt>こんげつ</rt></ruby>もよろしくお<ruby>願<rt>ねが</rt></ruby>いします！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>今月<rt>こんげつ</rt></ruby>はお<ruby>誕生<rt>たんじょう</rt></ruby><ruby>日<rt>び</rt></ruby>のメンバーが<ruby>多<rt>おお</rt></ruby>いんですよ〜</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">ちなみに<ruby>私<rt>わたし</rt></ruby>も<ruby>今月<rt>こんげつ</rt></ruby>で</span><span class=\"s1\">19</span><span class=\"s2\">になるんです</span><span class=\"s3\">😎</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">はやい〜〜</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>最近<rt>さいきん</rt></ruby><ruby>鼻<rt>はな</rt></ruby>かゆいんですけど<ruby>今<rt>いま</rt></ruby>って<ruby>花粉<rt>かふん</rt></ruby>あるんですかね。</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>小<rt>ちい</rt></ruby>さな<ruby>悩<rt>なや</rt></ruby>みです。</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">2</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>月<rt>つき</rt></ruby>も</span><span class=\"s1\">1</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>月<rt>つき</rt></ruby>に<ruby>負<rt>ま</rt></ruby>けないくらい<ruby>寒<rt>さむ</rt></ruby>いのであたたかくして<ruby>過<rt>す</rt></ruby>ごしましょうね</span><span class=\"s3\">☺️</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>私<rt>わたし</rt></ruby>は<ruby>毛布<rt>もうふ</rt></ruby>にくるまっています</span><span class=\"s3\">✌️</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>最近<rt>さいきん</rt></ruby>の<ruby>私<rt>わたし</rt></ruby>は</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>野球<rt>やきゅう</rt></ruby>を<ruby>知<rt>し</rt></ruby>りたいなー！と<ruby>思<rt>おも</rt></ruby>って<ruby>色々<rt>いろいろ</rt></ruby><ruby>調<rt>しら</rt></ruby>べて<ruby>勉強<rt>べんきょう</rt></ruby><ruby>中<rt>ちゅう</rt></ruby>です。</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>恥<rt>は</rt></ruby>ずかしながらシーズンとかもしっかりと<ruby>理解<rt>りかい</rt></ruby>せずにここまできたので</span><span class=\"s1\">1</span><span class=\"s2\">から<ruby>学<rt>まな</rt></ruby>んでいます</span><span class=\"s3\">⚾️</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">ベイスターズのキャンプの</span><span class=\"s1\">LIVE</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>配信<rt>はいしん</rt></ruby>やファンフェスのアーカイブなども<ruby>観<rt>み</rt></ruby>ました〜</span><span class=\"s3\">🏟</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">これからたくさんの<ruby>選手<rt>せんしゅ</rt></ruby>を<ruby>知<rt>し</rt></ruby>っていくのが<ruby>楽<rt>たの</rt></ruby>しみです！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>観<rt>み</rt></ruby>れる<ruby>時<rt>とき</rt></ruby>は<ruby>観<rt>み</rt></ruby>ていきたいです</span><span class=\"s3\">👀</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>試合<rt>しあい</rt></ruby>なども<ruby>観<rt>み</rt></ruby>るのも<ruby>楽<rt>たの</rt></ruby>しみです！！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">まだまだ<ruby>野球<rt>やきゅう</rt></ruby>について<ruby>何<rt>なに</rt></ruby>もわからないけどどんどん<ruby>知<rt>し</rt></ruby>っていこうと<ruby>思<rt>おも</rt></ruby>います！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">ぜひ<ruby>優<rt>やさ</rt></ruby>しく<ruby>教<rt>おし</rt></ruby>えて<ruby>下<rt>くだ</rt></ruby>さると<ruby>嬉<rt>うれ</rt></ruby>しいです</span><span class=\"s3\">☺️</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>野球<rt>やきゅう</rt></ruby><ruby>関連<rt>かんれん</rt></ruby>でいうと、</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">またまたバッティングセンター<ruby>行<rt>い</rt></ruby>きました<ruby>笑<rt>えみ</rt></ruby></span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">また！？ってなるけどほんとに<ruby>楽<rt>たの</rt></ruby>しくてハマっています</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>今回<rt>こんかい</rt></ruby>はめいさんとみくにちゃんと</span><span class=\"s1\">3</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>人<rt>ひと</rt></ruby>でした〜</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"><img alt=\"IMG_8568.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2023-02-02/49110_0.jpg\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>楽<rt>たの</rt></ruby>しかったよ〜</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">やっぱり<ruby>体<rt>からだ</rt></ruby><ruby>動<rt>うご</rt></ruby>かすのいいよね！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"><img alt=\"image0.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2023-02-02/49110_1.jpg\"><img alt=\"IMG_8566.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2023-02-02/49110_2.jpg\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><img alt=\"image2.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2023-02-02/49110_3.jpg\"><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><img alt=\"IMG_8492.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2023-02-02/49110_4.jpg\"></span></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\">バッティングの４コマ</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><img alt=\"IMG_8574.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2023-02-02/49110_5.jpg\"></span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><img alt=\"IMG_8575.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2023-02-02/49110_6.jpg\"></span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><img alt=\"IMG_8576.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2023-02-02/49110_7.jpg\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><img alt=\"IMG_8577.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2023-02-02/49110_8.jpg\"></span></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\">ピッチングの<ruby>四<rt>よん</rt></ruby>コマ</span></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\"><ruby>距離<rt>きょり</rt></ruby><ruby>近<rt>ちか</rt></ruby>いけど</span><span class=\"s2\">94km</span><span class=\"s3\">いったの<ruby>嬉<rt>うれ</rt></ruby>しかった</span><span class=\"s4\">🥹</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\"><ruby>最後<rt>さいご</rt></ruby>まで<ruby>読<rt>よ</rt></ruby>んで<ruby>下<rt>くだ</rt></ruby>さりありがとうございました。</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\">では、またね</span><span class=\"s4\">🐒</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\"><ruby>山口<rt>やまぐち</rt></ruby><ruby>陽<rt>よう</rt></ruby><ruby>世<rt>よ</rt></ruby>でした</span><span class=\"s4\">👋🏻</span><span class=\"s2\">‪</span></p></div></div></div>\n                    ",
